  "body": "[MSC2000](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2000) was closed, we should likely remove support for it at some point. It will be obsoleted by the OIDC work anyway, so we can likely wait until that removes a bunch of the auth code, but it seemed worth having a separate tracking issue.\r\n\r\nNote that this landed before we had processes around handling experimental code (from MSCs) in Synapse so it landed with stable identifiers, etc. See #7118 (originally #5214 in the dinsic branch).",
